import assert from 'node:assert/strict';import fs from 'node:fs/promises';import path from 'node:path';import os from 'node:os';import {createHash} from 'node:crypto';import {spawn} from 'node:child_process';import {pathToFileURL} from 'node:url';import {unescapeTapJson} from './tap-observations.mjs';
const root=import.meta.dirname,app='products/rea-studio/apps/vault/',study=app+'results/history-followup/',repo=path.resolve(root,'../../outputs/rea-research-lab'),sha=b=>createHash('sha256').update(b).digest('hex'),read=n=>fs.readFile(path.join(root,n)),json=async n=>JSON.parse(await read(n)),run='runs/'+new Date().toISOString().replaceAll(':','-');await fs.mkdir(path.join(root,run),{recursive:true});
const preserved=await json(study+'preservation-manifest.json'),adapted=await json('adaptations.json'),baseline=await json('production-baseline.json'),probeProvenance=await json('independent-probe-provenance.json');assert.equal(preserved.count,1454);assert.equal(preserved.publicInertSnapshots,1450);assert.equal(preserved.localCarriers,4);
async function authenticate(){for(const e of preserved.files){assert.ok(e.preservedPath&&!e.preservedPath.startsWith('/')&&!e.preservedPath.split('/').includes('..')&&!e.preservedPath.includes('\\'));const b=await read(e.preservedPath);assert.equal(b.length,e.bytes);assert.equal(sha(b),e.sha256,e.originalPath);}assert.equal(sha(await read(preserved.manifestCarrier.path)),preserved.originalManifestSha256);for(const e of adapted.runtime){assert.equal(sha(await read(e.path)),e.sha256,e.path);}for(const e of adapted.changes){assert.equal(sha(await read(e.path)),e.newSha256,e.path);}for(const e of probeProvenance.originalInputs)assert.equal(sha(await read('independent-source-inputs/'+e.path+'.snapshot')),e.sha256);}
async function walk(relative){const out=[];for(const e of await fs.readdir(path.join(root,relative),{withFileTypes:true})){if(e.name==='results'||e.name==='.local')continue;const n=relative+'/'+e.name;if(e.isDirectory())out.push(...await walk(n));else if(e.isFile())out.push(n);else throw new Error('Unexpected source link');}return out;}
const files=[...(await walk('products')),...(await walk('independent-probes')),'record-adapter.mjs','tap-observations.mjs','prepare-keepass-history-production-adapter.mjs','prepare-independent-probes.mjs','adaptations.json','production-baseline.json','independent-probe-provenance.json',study+'preservation-manifest.json',study+'NOTICE.md','README.md','finalize-adapter.mjs'];
async function capture(snapshot){await authenticate();const result=[];for(const name of [...new Set(files)].sort()){const b=await read(name);result.push({path:name,bytes:b.length,sha256:sha(b)});if(snapshot){const target=path.join(root,run,'sources',name+'.snapshot');await fs.mkdir(path.dirname(target),{recursive:true});await fs.writeFile(target,b);}}return result;}
async function external(){const out=[];for(const e of baseline.files){const b=await fs.readFile(path.join(repo,e.path));assert.equal(b.length,e.bytes);assert.equal(sha(b),e.sha256,'Production baseline changed '+e.path);out.push(e);}const exe=path.join(repo,'projects/07-keepass/artifacts/portable/KeePass.exe'),b=await fs.readFile(exe);assert.equal(sha(b),'04d29636c393f0c1fc99ff739295494be3adefded93271e44591e8e300225a5a');out.push({path:'projects/07-keepass/artifacts/portable/KeePass.exe',bytes:b.length,sha256:sha(b)});assert.equal(out.find(e=>e.path===app+'compatibility-evidence.json').sha256,baseline.old18ReceiptSha256);return{fingerprints:out,exe};}
const before=await capture(true),outsideBefore=await external();await fs.writeFile(path.join(root,run,'source-before.json'),JSON.stringify(before,null,2));
async function child(label,args,extra={}){const env={...process.env,...extra,REA_KEEPASS_EXE:outsideBefore.exe};delete env.NODE_TEST_CONTEXT;let error,stdout=[],stderr=[],outBytes=0,errBytes=0;const p=spawn(process.execPath,args,{cwd:root,env,windowsHide:true,stdio:['ignore','pipe','pipe']});const stop=reason=>{error??=reason;p.kill();};const timer=setTimeout(()=>stop('child-deadline'),90000);p.stdout.on('data',b=>{outBytes+=b.length;if(outBytes>8*1024*1024)stop('stdout-cap');else stdout.push(b);});p.stderr.on('data',b=>{errBytes+=b.length;if(errBytes>2*1024*1024)stop('stderr-cap');else stderr.push(b);});const result=await new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{p.once('error',reject);p.once('close',(code,signal)=>resolve({code,signal}));}).finally(()=>clearTimeout(timer));const text=Buffer.concat(stdout).toString('utf8'),errors=Buffer.concat(stderr).toString('utf8'),counts={};for(const key of ['tests','pass','fail','skipped','cancelled'])counts[key]=Number(text.match(new RegExp('^# '+key+' (\\d+)$','m'))?.[1]??-1);await fs.writeFile(path.join(root,run,label+'.stdout.txt'),text);await fs.writeFile(path.join(root,run,label+'.stderr.txt'),errors);const processReceipt={...result,error,counts,stdoutBytes:outBytes,stderrBytes:errBytes,args,deadlineMs:90000,stdoutCap:8*1024*1024,stderrCap:2*1024*1024};await fs.writeFile(path.join(root,run,label+'.process.json'),JSON.stringify(processReceipt,null,2));assert.equal(error,undefined);assert.equal(result.code,0,text+'\n'+errors);return{text,receipt:processReceipt};}
const focused=await child('focused',['--test','--test-reporter=tap',...adapted.tests.map(n=>app+n)]);assert.deepEqual(focused.receipt.counts,{tests:41,pass:41,fail:0,skipped:0,cancelled:0});
function marker(label){const prefix='# '+label+' ',lines=focused.text.split(/\r?\n/),starts=lines.flatMap((l,n)=>l.startsWith(prefix)?[n]:[]);assert.equal(starts.length,1,label);let value='';for(let n=starts[0];n<lines.length&&n<starts[0]+4096;n++){const line=lines[n];if(n===starts[0])value+=line.slice(prefix.length);else{if(!line.startsWith('# ')||line.startsWith('# Subtest:'))break;value+=line.slice(2);}assert.ok(value.length<=1024*1024);try{return JSON.parse(unescapeTapJson(value));}catch{}}throw new Error('Incomplete observation marker');}
const details=[];let originalLoads=0,hostProcesses=0;for(const [label,name]of [['REA_KEEPASS_HISTORY_ORIGINAL','history-original'],['REA_KEEPASS_HISTORY_HTTP','history-http'],['REA_KEEPASS_HISTORY_UNKNOWN','history-unknown-time']]){const m=marker(label);assert.equal(typeof m.detail,'string');const source=path.resolve(m.detail),expected=path.join(root,'.local/vault-history-fixtures')+path.sep;assert.ok(source.startsWith(expected),'Observation outside private fixture folder');const b=await fs.readFile(source);assert.ok(b.length<=4*1024*1024);const data=JSON.parse(b);assert.equal(data.originalProcessExecutions,m.originalProcessExecutions);originalLoads+=m.originalProcessExecutions;hostProcesses+=m.hostProcesses??0;await fs.writeFile(path.join(root,run,name+'.json'),b);details.push({path:run+'/'+name+'.json',bytes:b.length,sha256:sha(b),originalProcessExecutions:m.originalProcessExecutions,hostProcesses:m.hostProcesses??0});}
assert.equal(originalLoads,24);assert.equal(hostProcesses,5);
const independentTests=['restore-selection.test.mjs','selection-boundaries.test.mjs','same-editor-draft.test.mjs','preexisting-draft.test.mjs','timer/idle-view.test.mjs'],probeOutput=path.join(root,'.local/independent-observations');await fs.mkdir(probeOutput,{recursive:true});const independent=await child('independent-probes',['--test','--test-concurrency=1','--test-reporter=tap',...independentTests.map(n=>'independent-probes/'+n)],{VAULT_REVIEW_STAGE:path.join(root,app),VAULT_REVIEW_OUTPUT:probeOutput});assert.deepEqual(independent.receipt.counts,{tests:11,pass:11,fail:0,skipped:0,cancelled:0});const observed=[];for(const name of await fs.readdir(probeOutput)){const b=await fs.readFile(path.join(probeOutput,name)),target=run+'/independent-observations/'+name;await fs.mkdir(path.dirname(path.join(root,target)),{recursive:true});await fs.writeFile(path.join(root,target),b);observed.push({path:target,bytes:b.length,sha256:sha(b)});}const wrongEntry=await read('independent-probes/.local/restore-selection-observation.json');await fs.writeFile(path.join(root,run,'independent-observations/restore-selection-observation.json'),wrongEntry);observed.push({path:run+'/independent-observations/restore-selection-observation.json',bytes:wrongEntry.length,sha256:sha(wrongEntry)});
const{start}=await import(pathToFileURL(path.join(root,'products/rea-studio/server.mjs'))),data=await fs.mkdtemp(path.join(os.tmpdir(),'rea-vault-adapter-routes-'));let host;const routes=[];try{host=await start({port:0,dataDir:data});for(const [url,expected]of [['/apps/vault/client.mjs',200],['/api/health',200],['/apps/vault/server.mjs',404],['/apps/vault/history.mjs',404],['/apps/vault/kdbx.mjs',404],['/apps/vault/xml.mjs',404],['/apps/vault/harness.mjs',404],['/apps/vault/history-oracle.ps1',404],['/apps/vault/keepass-oracle.ps1',404],['/apps/vault/results/history-followup/NOTICE.md',404],['/apps/vault/results/history-followup/stage/source/KeePassLib/PwEntry.cs.snapshot',404],['/apps/vault/results/history-followup/preservation-manifest.json',404]]){const response=await fetch(host.url+url);await response.arrayBuffer();assert.equal(response.status,expected,url);routes.push({url,status:response.status});}}finally{await host?.close();assert.equal(path.dirname(data),path.resolve(os.tmpdir()));assert.ok(path.basename(data).startsWith('rea-vault-adapter-routes-'));await fs.rm(data,{recursive:true,force:true});}
for(const name of ['server.mjs','history.mjs','kdbx.mjs','xml.mjs','client.mjs'])assert.doesNotMatch((await read(app+name)).toString('utf8'),/from\s+['"][^'"]*(?:harness|oracle|history-followup|source\/)|node:child_process|runInNewContext|stripTypeScriptTypes/);
const notice=(await read(study+'NOTICE.md')).toString('utf8'),appReadme=(await read(app+'README.md')).toString('utf8');for(const [base,text]of [[study,notice],[app,appReadme]])for(const match of text.matchAll(/\]\(([^)]+)\)/g)){if(!match[1].startsWith('stage/')&&!match[1].startsWith('results/history-followup/'))continue;await fs.access(path.join(root,base,match[1]));}
const after=await capture(false),outsideAfter=await external();assert.deepEqual(after,before);assert.deepEqual(outsideAfter.fingerprints,outsideBefore.fingerprints);await fs.writeFile(path.join(root,run,'source-after.json'),JSON.stringify(after,null,2));const receipt={schema:'rea-vault-production-adapter-run/v1',checkedAt:new Date().toISOString(),run,counts:focused.receipt.counts,additionalIndependentProbeCounts:independent.receipt.counts,sourceStable:true,productionChanged:false,runtimeByteIdentical:true,sourceBefore:before,sourceAfter:after,externalBefore:outsideBefore.fingerprints,externalAfter:outsideAfter.fingerprints,preservation:{allFrozen1454Exact:true,publicInertSnapshots:1450,localOriginalCarriers:4,originalManifestSha256:preserved.originalManifestSha256,originalReceiptSha256:preserved.originalReceiptSha256},adaptations:adapted.changes,independentProvenance:probeProvenance,originalAccounting:{assemblyLoads:24,additionalIndependentProbeOriginalExecutions:0,originalGuiExecutions:0,originalTouchExecutions:0,originalFullProductExecutions:0},candidateAccounting:{focusedDOMElementModelGroups:25,additionalIndependentDOMProbeGroups:11,actualSharedHostTestProcesses:5,additionalPrivateRouteHostStarts:1,browserExecutions:0},originalDetails:details,independentObservations:observed,routes,normalTestsWriteAppResults:false,sourceOnlyPathsPrivate:true,applicationImportsOriginalRuntime:false,old18CompatibilityReceiptSha256:baseline.old18ReceiptSha256,oldCompatibilityRebound:false,fullProductParity:false,securityParity:false,superiority:false};await fs.writeFile(path.join(root,run,'validation.json'),JSON.stringify(receipt,null,2)+'\n');console.log(JSON.stringify({run,counts:receipt.counts,independent:receipt.additionalIndependentProbeCounts,originalLoads,hostProcesses,sourceStable:true}));
